; The positive controls (tests/README.md): toy binaries written for this
; repository, their statements, and finished proofs of them.  Built by a plain
; `dune build`; never installed.  tests/negative/ holds proofs that must be
; rejected, so dune never compiles it: tests/check.sh does, and requires each
; one to fail.
